# Whitelist: only the viewer's code, launchers and guide go in git.
# data/ (built from your own library) and the build caches never do.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/*.bat
!/*.md
!/index.html
!/app.js
!/app.css
!/config.js
!/icon.svg
!/vendor/
!/_build/

/_build/*
!/_build/*.py
!/_build/*.ps1
__pycache__/
